                "text": "Given bounded input $x(t)=1$, compare $y_d(t)=\\int_0^t e^{-2(t-\\tau)}x(\\tau)d\\tau$ and $y_u(t)=\\int_0^t x(\\tau)d\\tau$. Which statement is correct about boundedness under this input?",
