                    "text": "$y_d(t)$ is bounded: $y_d(t)=\\int_0^t e^{-2(t-\\tau)}d\\tau=\\frac{1}{2}(1-e^{-2t})$, while $y_u(t)=\\int_0^t 1\\,d\\tau=t$ is unbounded.",
